sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant D as Training data
    participant M as Model
    participant L as Loss
    participant Om as Optimizer
    participant GPUs as GPU fleet
    D->>M: batch of sequences
    M->>M: forward pass, predict every next token
    M->>L: compare against the actual next token
    L->>M: backward pass — gradients for every weight
    M->>GPUs: all-reduce gradients across ranks
    Note over GPUs: this is why interconnect bandwidth decides training throughput
    GPUs->>Om: averaged gradients
    Om->>M: update the weights
    loop many times
        Note over D,Om: pretraining, then fine-tuning, then preference training
    end
    M->>M: checkpoint — a crash without one costs the whole run
